{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"function createToolRegistry<TTool>(initialTools?): ToolRegistry<TTool>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/tool-registry.ts#L78","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/tool-registry.ts:78"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Create a mutable tool registry for dynamic tool scenarios."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Tools can be added and removed during chat execution, and the\nchanges will be reflected in subsequent agent loop iterations."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"ttool","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TTool"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TTool"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/AnyTool.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"AnyTool"}]},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/AnyTool.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"AnyTool"}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"initialtools","children":[{"type":"text","value":"initialTools?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TTool"},{"type":"text","value":"[] = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"[]"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Optional initial set of tools"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/ToolRegistry.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ToolRegistry"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TTool"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A mutable ToolRegistry"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"const registry = createToolRegistry([toolA, toolB])\n\nconst stream = chat({\n  adapter,\n  messages,\n  toolRegistry: registry,\n})\n\n// Later, during tool execution:\nregistry.add(newTool)  // Immediately available to LLM","lang":"typescript"}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"ttool","text":"TTool","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"initialtools","text":"initialTools?","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction createToolRegistry<TTool>(initialTools?): ToolRegistry<TTool>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/tool-registry.ts:78](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/tool-registry.ts#L78)\n\nCreate a mutable tool registry for dynamic tool scenarios.\n\nTools can be added and removed during chat execution, and the\nchanges will be reflected in subsequent agent loop iterations.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TTool\n\n`TTool` *extends* [`AnyTool`](../type-aliases/AnyTool.md) = [`AnyTool`](../type-aliases/AnyTool.md)\n\n## Parameters\n\n### initialTools?\n\n`TTool`[] = `[]`\n\nOptional initial set of tools\n\n## Returns\n\n[`ToolRegistry`](../interfaces/ToolRegistry.md)\\<`TTool`\\>\n\nA mutable ToolRegistry\n\n## Example\n\n```typescript\nconst registry = createToolRegistry([toolA, toolB])\n\nconst stream = chat({\n  adapter,\n  messages,\n  toolRegistry: registry,\n})\n\n// Later, during tool execution:\nregistry.add(newTool)  // Immediately available to LLM\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: createToolRegistry\ntitle: createToolRegistry\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction createToolRegistry<TTool>(initialTools?): ToolRegistry<TTool>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/tool-registry.ts:78](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/tool-registry.ts#L78)\n\nCreate a mutable tool registry for dynamic tool scenarios.\n\nTools can be added and removed during chat execution, and the\nchanges will be reflected in subsequent agent loop iterations.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TTool\n\n`TTool` *extends* [`AnyTool`](../type-aliases/AnyTool.md) = [`AnyTool`](../type-aliases/AnyTool.md)\n\n## Parameters\n\n### initialTools?\n\n`TTool`[] = `[]`\n\nOptional initial set of tools\n\n## Returns\n\n[`ToolRegistry`](../interfaces/ToolRegistry.md)\\<`TTool`\\>\n\nA mutable ToolRegistry\n\n## Example\n\n```typescript\nconst registry = createToolRegistry([toolA, toolB])\n\nconst stream = chat({\n  adapter,\n  messages,\n  toolRegistry: registry,\n})\n\n// Later, during tool execution:\nregistry.add(newTool)  // Immediately available to LLM\n```\n"}
